WEBVTT

00:04:29.265 --> 00:04:31.642
In it, you learn to identify
upsetting thoughts

00:04:31.642 --> 00:04:33.561
and determine whether they're realistic.

00:04:33.602 --> 00:04:37.982
Over time, cognitive behavioral therapy
can rebuild those neural pathways

00:04:38.024 --> 00:04:40.568
that tamp down the anxiety response.

00:04:40.568 --> 00:04:43.070
Medication can also give relief,

00:04:43.070 --> 00:04:45.781
in both the short-term and the long-term.

00:04:45.823 --> 00:04:48.075
In the short-term, anti-anxiety drugs

00:04:48.117 --> 00:04:50.453
can down-regulate
the threat-detection mechanisms

00:04:50.494 --> 00:04:52.330
that are going into overdrive.

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:55.624
Studies have shown
that both long-term medications

00:04:55.666 --> 00:04:57.710
and cognitive behavioral therapy

00:04:57.710 --> 00:05:00.546
can reduce that overreactivity
of the amygdala